Filtering with Multiple Conditions
Suppose we need marks between 60 and 80.
marks = np.array([45, 78, 90, 55, 82, 60, 70])

result = marks[(marks >= 60) & (marks <= 80)]

print(result)
Output:
[78 60 70]
Here:
& = AND
Both conditions must be true.
________________________________________
OR Condition
Suppose we want marks:
•	Less than 50 
•	OR greater than 80 
result = marks[(marks < 50) | (marks > 80)]

print(result)
Output:
[45 90 82]
Here:
| = OR
At least one condition must be true.
